Coastline detection data
------------------------
Land and lakes: Natural Earth 1:50m physical vectors, via
https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector - public domain.

US state outlines in lon/lat, used only to recover the projection us-atlas was
built with: Natural Earth 1:50m admin_1 states/provinces, same source.

Used by src/build-coast.py to decide which stretches of border have water on the
far side. No water geometry ships in the game; only the coastal borders do.
